---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base>
  <h1>A world being rebuilt with care.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Atrinik is an open-source cooperative role-playing game. The current effort
    is creating a clean-room, independently maintained engine while preserving
    the project’s authored world and its exact licenses.
  </p>
  <section aria-labelledby="status-heading" class="panel">
    <h2 id="status-heading">Current status</h2>
    <p>
      Replacement downloads are not published yet. Classic and replacement
      packages will remain clearly distinguished, with immutable checksums and
      compatibility details, before links appear here.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
